          "ruleId": "R8-totality-guard-mutation",
          "level": "note",
          "message": {
            "text": "Seven mutants of the kind-totality guard and the registry, each applied with sed in a detached worktree and restored by git checkout (porcelain empty after). M1 drops the verdict vocabulary check (:1196), M2 the model-kind key check (:1225), M3 the use_instead target-must-receipt check (:1172), M4 the no-model-requires-model check (:1203), M5 loosens the mixed no-model count (:1234), M6 deletes explain's kinds line in the registry, M7 points a use_instead at a command that does not exist. Base rc 0 (2 passed); every mutant rc 101 (1 failed); final rc 0. 7/7 killed."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "crates/apr-cli/tests/cli_commands.rs"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 1196
